// Instance 3 has 50 arms whose prior means are between 0.2 and 0.6 and
// whose priors are worth 2 to 200 pulls, drawn at random. In
// simulation a greedy policy wins about 198, Thompson sampling 217 and
// the online knowledge gradient 222; knowing the true probabilities
// would win 252.

